## Completion — Emit the Implemented Graph

```
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
IMPLEMENTED GRAPH: <CURRENT_NAME>
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

WAVE 1 — Open Exploration (C_NODE_COUNT = n)
  C1  status=...  slug=...  output=./.harness/scratchs/c1_<slug>.md  findings=...  unknowns=...
  ...
  Cn  status=...  slug=...  output=./.harness/scratchs/cn_<slug>.md  findings=...  unknowns=...

WAVE 2 — Cross-Examination
