WAVE 4 — Research Thread Synthesis (m threads, dynamically derived post-WAVE-2)
  RS1  status=...  slug=...  index=01  output=./.harness/researchs/01-<slug>.md
                  findings=...  open_questions=...  gaps=...  prior_preserved=...
  ...
  RSm  status=...  slug=...  index=0m  output=./.harness/researchs/0m-<slug>.md
